      'From xx0211 (D–A–C–F) up to the 12th fret: D–A–C–F, E–B♭–C♯–G, F–C–D–A, G–C♯–E–B♭, A–D–F–C, B♭–E–G–C♯, C–F–A–D, C♯–G–B♭–E.',
