      'The dominant scale of chords: G7 in its four inversions, each followed by E♭°7. From xx0001 (D–G–B–F): D–G–B–F, E♭–A–C–F♯, F–B–D–G, F♯–C–E♭–A, G–D–F–B, A–E♭–F♯–C, B–F–G–D, C–F♯–A–E♭.',
