      '- Keep the bass and top fingers ready but light: they come and go, while the pair holding the 3rd moves every chord',
      '<b>Harder</b>: the same on the F6-dim and C6-dim scales. From the Guitar Luminary handout “Inner Third Motion in Drop-2 Voicings”.',
