      '<b>Harder</b>: the handout’s block-chord version, which mixes drop 2 with drop 3 (Am6 as A–F♯–C–E from the low E string, 5x455x) so the top voice moves by step through the changes. From the Guitar Luminary handouts “Corcovado Drop Voicings and Voice Leading Study” and “Jobim Handout”.',
